WEBVTT

00:03:58.581 --> 00:04:02.054
Carol was completely innocent,
but she lost her car nonetheless.

00:04:02.078 --> 00:04:03.229
In other words,

00:04:03.253 --> 00:04:06.768
she was punished for a crime
she did not commit.

00:04:07.671 --> 00:04:11.384
When I read this, I was gobsmacked.

00:04:12.431 --> 00:04:13.582
How could this occur?

00:04:13.606 --> 00:04:15.534
How is this even legal?

00:04:16.794 --> 00:04:19.612
It turns out, it began in our country
with maritime law.

00:04:19.636 --> 00:04:23.225
Early in our republic, the government
sought to fight piracy --

00:04:23.249 --> 00:04:24.968
yes, actual pirates.

00:04:25.581 --> 00:04:29.186
The problem was the government
often couldn't catch the pirates,

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:33.069
so instead it used civil forfeiture
to convict the pirates' property